OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman wins dismissal of
OL,4,Asister's lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI chief executive Sam Altman has
OL,7,Fwon a dismissal of a lawsuit brought
OL,8,Fagainst him by his sister that claimed
OL,9,Fhe had sexually abused her more than
OL,10,Ftwo decades ago.
OL,12,FA US district judge dismissed the case
OL,13,Fafter Ann Altman had refused to attend
OL,14,Fan independent medical examination,
OL,15,Fadding she was warned a failure to do
OL,16,Fso would result in the case being
OL,17,Fthrown out.
OL,19,FAnn Altman had claimed the OpenAI
OL,20,Ffounder had regularly sexually abused
OL,21,Fher between 1997 and 2006. Sam Altman
OL,22,Fhas denied those accusations.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
