OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman wins dismissal of
OL,4,Asister's lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Altman family has said Ann Altman
OL,7,Fhas mental health challenges and they
OL,8,Fhave supported her financially, adding
OL,9,Fthe claims were made as she continued
OL,10,Fto demand more funds.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
